    <guid isPermaLink="false">69bba9c92d318777c9afc1fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Mar 2026 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春天来了，万物复苏，又到了动物们繁殖的季节，山林的空气中弥漫着荷尔蒙的气息，今天我们想要和大家聊一聊亲密接触那些事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>/主播/：王老师，疯疯</span></p><span></span><p><span>/策划&amp;剪辑/：疯疯</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 你那里的春天是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 亲密接触只能和关系亲密的人发生吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 近期亲密接触体验：拥抱小辈，拥抱长辈，拥抱同辈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 令人不适的亲密接触：来自校园，来自职场，来自家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 如果没有亲密接触我们会怎样：烦躁？孤独？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 恋人之间的亲密接触：从牵手到性行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">43:25</a> 亲密关系中，在互相尊重的基础上，记得更多的表达自己的需求</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【影音】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Yawn from SEVENTEEN Vocal Unit Team</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【加听友群】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加小助手微信：tlrc2023</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听渠道】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、苹果播客、荔枝、网易云、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索 “脱离日常”</span></p>]]></description>
