    <guid isPermaLink="false">6984ca84c78b823892ddb556</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Feb 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>丙午马年就要到了，你准备好过年了吗？有没有置办年货，有没有准备红包，有没有买好车票，有没有计划好新年日程？最重要的是，你还期待过年吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/主播/</span></strong><span>：抢到演唱会票但是胃部不适的疯疯，PMS中经前期不适的松子，头痛到想要立马退休的王老师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/策划和剪辑/</span></strong><span>：疯疯</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">00:03:45</a> 春节记忆·春晚记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">00:11:00</a> 春节记忆·春运记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">00:18:00</a> 春节记忆·小时候的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">00:32:05</a> 年夜饭必吃榜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">00:42:00</a> 王老师：比起吃，我更喜欢当伙夫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3029">00:50:29</a> 你还期待春节吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">01:00:30</a> 今年的过年计划</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【影音】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>中插：情非得已</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【加听友群】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加小助手微信：tlrc2023</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听渠道】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、苹果播客、荔枝、网易云、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索 “脱离日常”</span></p>]]></description>
